        "击飞"
      ],
      "summary_en": "Samira builds a combo by hitting attacks or abilities unique from the previous hit. Samira's attacks in melee range deal additional magic damage. Samira's attacks against enemies affected by Immobilizing effects will dash her to her attack range. If the enemy is Knocked Up, she also keeps them Knocked Up briefly.",
      "summary_zh": "莎弥拉可通过用不同的技能或攻击命中敌人来构建一次连招。莎弥拉在近战距离的攻击会造成额外的魔法伤害。莎弥拉在对被定身的敌人进行攻击时，将冲刺到她的最大攻击距离处。如果该敌人已被击飞，她还会使其短暂保持击飞状态。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
        "source:wiki:1459314:4051977"
      ]
    },
